Tool files__read_multiple_files: Read the contents of multiple files simultaneously. This is more efficient than reading files one by one when you need to analyze or compare multiple files.
Required arguments: paths.
Parameter contract: {"$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"encoding": {"default": "utf-8", "description": "File encoding (default: utf-8)", "type": "string"}, "paths": {"description": "Array of file paths to read", "items": {"type": "string"}, "type": "array"}}, "required": ["paths"], "type": "object"}
Shape example (substitute task values): {"arguments": {"paths": []}, "kind": "shape_only", "requires_task_values": true, "tool": "files__read_multiple_files"}

Tool files__write_file: Create a new file or completely overwrite an existing file with new content. Use with caution as it will overwrite existing files without warning.
Required arguments: path, content.
Parameter contract: {"$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"content": {"description": "The content to write to the file", "type": "string"}, "createDirectories": {"default": false, "description": "Create parent directories if they don't exist", "type": "boolean"}, "path": {"description": "The path to the file", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["path", "content"], "type": "object"}
Shape example (substitute task values): {"arguments": {"content": "<content>", "path": "<path>"}, "kind": "shape_only", "requires_task_values": true, "tool": "files__write_file"}

Tool time_mcp__current_time: Get the current date and time.
Required arguments: .
Parameter contract: {"$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#", "properties": {"format": {"default": "YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss", "description": "The format of the time", "enum": ["h:mm A", "h:mm:ss A", "YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss", "YYYY-MM-DD", "YYYY-MM", "MM/DD/YYYY", "MM/DD/YY", "YYYY/MM/DD", "YYYY/MM"], "type": "string"}, "timezone": {"description": "The timezone of the time, IANA timezone name, e.g. Asia/Shanghai", "type": "string"}}, "type": "object"}
Shape example (substitute task values): {"arguments": {}, "kind": "shape_only", "requires_task_values": true, "tool": "time_mcp__current_time"}
